  "how_to_tell_apart": "Look for som, čo, keď, len, teraz, zajtra, ďakujem and môžem, plus the letters ä, ô, ĺ and ŕ, none of which belong to standard Czech (which would have jsem, co, když, jen, teď, zítra, děkuji, můžu and ě/ř/ů). The reflexive is sa rather than Czech se. Words such as to, je, na and už occur on both sides and should be ignored when deciding.",
